  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      362.17,
      547.24,
      397.24
    ],
    "text": "IN terms of the powers vested in me under the Section 42(2) of the Poisons, Opium and Dangerous Drugs OrdinanceNo. 17 of 1929 (Chapter 549), I, Rajitha Senarathna, Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine do herebyamend the Opium Board constituted for Gampaha District as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      410.17,
      547.2,
      445.24
    ],
    "text": "Accordingly, Dr. (Mr) K. Sayakkara and Dr. (Mrs.) C. H. G. Kasthuriratne who were appointed as member of theDistrict Opium Board in the Gampaha District by Gazette Extraordinary No. 1638/6 and dated 25.01.2010 have beenreplaced by the following",
